# Runtime environment knobs for OCD Circuit.
# Copy to `.env` for your own notes if you like — the apps do not auto-load
# dotenv files (stdlib only). Export these in the shell, or prefix a command:
#   OCD_PORT=8078 python -m apps.studio boards/blinky_555.ocd
#
# `ocd doctor` prints the active values with secrets redacted (set/unset).
# See ocdcircuit/envcfg.py for the parsers and docs/STUDIO.md / docs/FAB.md.

# --- Studio (binds 127.0.0.1 only) ----------------------------------------
# OCD_PORT=8077
# OCD_ROOT=                 # project browser root (default: directory of the board)

# --- LLM (OpenAI-compatible: Ollama, LM Studio, DeepSeek, …) --------------
# OCD_LLM_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1
# OCD_LLM_MODEL=qwen3.5:latest
# OCD_LLM_EMBED=nomic-embed-text
# OCD_LLM_MAX_TOKENS=8192   # set 0 to omit the field (rare local servers)
# OCD_LLM_KEY=              # bearer token; leave empty for local servers

# --- Photo scan vision payload budget (megabytes) -------------------------
# OCD_SCAN_MAX_MB=24

# --- Reproducible fab.zip entry mtimes (Unix epoch; pre-1980 clamped) -----
# SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=0

# --- JLCPCB official parts API (never commit real values) -----------------
# Same keys may live in ~/.secrets/jlcpcb (AccessKey: / SecretKey: / AppID:).
# JLCPCB_APP_ID=
# JLCPCB_API_KEY=
# JLCPCB_API_SECRET=

# --- Optional: knoll checkout for live JLC pricing ------------------------
# When set, this path is the only candidate (a typo does not fall through
# to ~/Desktop/knoll/src). When unset, that Desktop path is still probed.
# KNOLL_SRC=

# --- KiCad 3D model library (path rewrite in .kicad_pcb exports) ----------
# Override when the auto-probe misses your install (Linux FHS, macOS
# KiCad.app SharedSupport, or Windows Program Files\KiCad\...).
# KICAD10_3DMODEL_DIR=/usr/share/kicad/3dmodels

# --- X-ray alignment overrides: dx,dy,scale,thr ---------------------------
# Parsed by ocdcircuit.envcfg.xray_overrides(); bad tokens fail at use.
# XRAY=

# --- scanbench only -------------------------------------------------------
# Truthy: 1 / true / yes / on. Listed by `ocd doctor` as SCANBENCH_LLM.
# SCANBENCH_LLM=1
# SCANBENCH_REPS=1
